<section id="services" aria-labelledby="h-svc">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><div class="dim" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div><p class="kick"><b>03</b>Plan to support</p><h2 id="h-svc">From first plan to long-term support</h2></div>
    <div class="bento snap" id="snap1">
      <a class="card b1" href="#planning">
        <div><h3>CCTV Implementation Planning</h3><p style="margin-top:12px">We study your property and requirements and prepare a dedicated plan before any equipment is installed.</p></div>
        <svg class="mini" viewBox="0 0 320 150" role="img" aria-label="Line drawing of a plan with camera coverage">
          <rect class="s d" x="10" y="12" width="200" height="124" rx="3" style="--k:0"/>
          <path class="s d" d="M110 12V70M10 70H210M70 70V136" style="--k:1"/>
          <rect class="pk2" x="224" y="22" width="86" height="114" rx="3"/>
          <g class="sw" style="transform-origin:40px 128px"><path class="k" d="M40 128L16 80Q40 65.6 64 80Z"/></g>
          <g class="sw" style="transform-origin:60px 22px;animation-delay:.3s"><path class="k" d="M60 22L22 64Q60 76.6 98 64Z"/></g>
          <g class="sw" style="transform-origin:216px 80px;animation-delay:.6s"><path class="k" d="M216 80L300 34Q325.2 80 300 126Z"/></g>
          <circle class="cm" cx="40" cy="128" r="4.5"/><circle class="cm" cx="60" cy="22" r="4.5"/><circle class="cm" cx="216" cy="80" r="4.5"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="tlink">Learn more</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card b2" href="#services"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="7" width="13" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M16 10l5-2.5v9L16 14M7 4h4"/></svg></span><h3>CCTV Installation</h3><p>The required CCTV infrastructure and equipment are installed according to the approved plan.</p><span class="tlink">Learn more</span></a>
      <a class="card b3" href="#services"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 7h10M18 7h2M4 17h2M10 17h10M14 4v6M8 14v6"/></svg></span><h3>System Setup and Configuration</h3><p>The system is configured and tested according to the implementation requirements.</p><span class="tlink">Learn more</span></a>
      <a class="card b4" href="#services"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 4.5-3.2 8-8 9-4.8-1-8-4.5-8-9V6zM8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg></span><div><h3>Long-Term Support</h3><p style="margin-top:6px">Support for the implemented CCTV surveillance solution, beyond the day of installation.</p></div><span class="tlink">Learn more</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="swipe" aria-hidden="true">Swipe to see all services<span class="dots" id="dots1"><i class="on"></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div>
    <div class="svc5">
      <p class="svc5-t">Also offered</p>
      <ul class="stg">
        <li class="sv"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 4.5-3.2 8-8 9-4.8-1-8-4.5-8-9V6zM8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg></span>Security solutions</li>
        <li class="sv"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 5h18v11H3zM8 20h8M12 16v4M6.5 10.5s2.2-3 5.5-3 5.5 3 5.5 3-2.2 3-5.5 3-5.5-3-5.5-3z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10.5" r="1.2"/></svg></span>Remote monitoring</li>
        <li class="sv"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="7" y="2.5" width="10" height="19" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"/><path d="M11 18h2"/></svg></span>Smart surveillance</li>
